Hi again,

Here the golden rule is too always start with a low resolution isoscape so that if something is not right you notice after 30 seconds and not 17351.
Once you make it work, then increase the resolution.
I think the issue here as nothing to do with IsoriX.

I am afraid that this discussion is not getting interested for all the people in this group.
The mailing list is for general issues and discussions, but you seem to bump into a wall at each step (which can happen, no judgement).
So before people pull out from this list, I propose to continue directly in private: please email me at cour...@izw-berlin.de
So please email me there and I'll do my best to sort you out!

++

